## Anatomy

```tsx
const {
  SvgIndicator,
  inputStyle,
  indicatorReady,
  checkedIndicatorReady,
  indeterminateIndicatorReady,
} = Checkers.useSvgIndicator({
  indicator: <svg />,
  checkedIndicator: <svg />,
  indeterminateIndicator: <svg />,
})
```

